---
/**
 * Encodes the standing rule that buttons stack block-level at phone widths and sit inline from
 * the small breakpoint up. Buttons live inside this wrapper so the rule is structural rather
 * than something each page remembers. Assertion A18 in scripts/seo-check.ts fails the build on a
 * button-styled link that is not inside one.
 */
---

<div data-button-row class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center">
    <slot />
</div>
